GarageFlow
Task 4: Defining Primary and Foreign Keys

This section defines the primary and foreign keys for each table established in Task 3
PK: Primary Key
FK: Foreign Key

---

## Structure of a Garage

`garage`
  • PK: garage_id

`floor`
  • PK: floor_id
  • FK: garage_id -> garage(garage_id)

`parking_spot`
  • PK: spot_id
  • FK: floor_id -> floor(floor_id)

`gate_event`
  • PK: gate_id
  • FK: garage_id -> garage(garage_id)


## Users

`customer`
  • PK: customer_id

`vehicle`
  • PK: vehicle_id
  • FK: customer_id -> customer(customer_id)

`staff`
  • PK: operator_id


## Parking Process

`ticket`
  • PK: ticket_id
  • FK: entry_gate_id -> gate_event(gate_id)
        exit_gate_id -> gate_event(gate_id)
        spot_id -> parking_spot(spot_id)
        vehicle_id -> vehicle(vehicle_id)

`payment`
  • PK: payment_id
  • FK: ticket_id -> ticket(ticket_id)

`reservation`
  • PK: reservation_id
  • FK: cutomer_id -> customer(customer_id)
        vehicle_id -> vehicle(vehicle_id)


## System Analytics

`occupancy_log`
  • PK: log_id
  • FK: spot_id -> parking_spot(spot_id)

`system_event`
  • PK: event_id


## Operations

`pricing_rule`
  • PK: rate_id

